GROOT is a read-only log and context collector for Kubernetes. It writes a
timestamped tarball containing pod logs, events, resource manifests, node
details, and (optionally) notify fan-out for Slack, Discord, Teams,
PagerDuty, generic webhooks, and email. GROOT is a single command:

  groot collect --config /usr/local/etc/groot/groot.yml

The runtime is client-go end-to-end; no kubectl binary is required.

WWW: https://github.com/hrodrig/groot
